# CWMenu 3 - adds the `project` block (feature switches: cursor, zoom,
# scroll, devtools, history - all ON by default) and `when <expr>` element
# conditionals: the host injects the effective values (package.json keys)
# via cwm_project_set() before load, then every element tagged with
# `when <switch>` is dropped when the switch is off, so disabled features
# remove their menu items entirely.  The controller parses ANY version
# and ignores constructs newer than itself, so older hosts still load this.
CWMenu 3

# Theme block (CWMenu 2): the script owns every menu color slot.  These values
# mirror the built-in C fallbacks exactly (zero visual change) - edit them
# here to re-skin the whole native shell without touching C.
#   accentN     accent colors used by Settings > Accent color
#   labelN      display names for the same accents (label0 = accent0)
#   text-normal/light/dim   text colors by element style
#   neutral     the un-tinted chrome base
#   overlay     menu backdrop rgb (alpha stays fixed in the host)
theme
    accent0 #466996
    accent1 #B43737
    accent2 #CD7030
    accent3 #379155
    accent4 #2D9BAF
    accent5 #5C3787
    label0 "Blue"
    label1 "Red"
    label2 "Orange"
    label3 "Green"
    label4 "Cyan"
    label5 "Dark Purple"
    text-normal #EBF0FA
    text-light #FFF8EE
    text-dim #9BA5B4
    neutral #96A0AF
    overlay #000000
end

# Project block (CWMenu 3): script-side DEFAULTS.  The host injects the
# package.json values before load (cwm_project_set wins over these lines);
# these defaults make the script self-describing when no host injects.
project
    cursor on
    zoom on
    scroll on
    devtools on
    history on
    files on
end

menu main
element window window 0 0 740 436 normal ""
element header header 0 0 740 44 normal "CWebView"
element devtools button 610 7 112 30 normal "DevTools" action devtools when devtools
# (84) Files: web-content tree browser.  The host also draws this button
# natively (one button-width left of devtools) for legacy scripts.
element files button 486 7 112 30 normal "Files" action files when files
element page-label text 20 62 80 24 normal "Page"
element page-icon panel 20 94 70 70 normal ""
element page-info text 104 94 560 70 normal ""
element page-separator underline 20 180 700 1 normal ""
# CWMenu 4: the More row opens a LINKED script (extras.cwm) whose menu
# re-renders this same set of choices in the inline settings/devtools
# grammar - the stock main menu above stays untouched.
element page-operations button 20 204 700 42 normal "Page Operations" action page-operations
element open-url button 20 242 700 42 normal "Open URL..." action open-url
element settings button 20 280 700 42 normal "Settings" action settings
element more button 20 318 700 42 normal "More" action open_script:extras.cwm|more_main
element footer-separator underline 20 366 700 1 normal ""
element back button 20 376 150 38 normal "Back" action back
element footer footer 190 376 530 38 normal ""
end

