# ---- CWMenu 2 window-spec demo: dual windows ---------------------------------
# tests_windows is the navigable menu (tab 8 of the advanced page).  Its
# window element carries the `pair` key, so tests_windows_pair renders as a
# live second surface with its own anchor / size / corner / crop.  The five
# toggle buttons live-edit the partner window at runtime - no C changes.

# Partner surface for the dual-window demo.  THIS window element owns its
# own geometry: absolute anchor 560,120, chrome scale 1.0, rounded corners,
# no crop.  The host renders it through pair + vita_native_menu_find();
# input stays with the active menu.
